          "role": "user",
          "content": "<email_document>\nFrom: sofia.borg@harbourlight.example\nSubject: DMA offer - MV Scheldt Express - Antwerp\n\nDear colleagues,\n\nPlease see our firm offer below.\n\nVessel          Scheldt Express\nLocation        Antwerp outer anchorage\nDelivery date   Nov 21-23\n\n\nGRADE      QUANTITY   PRICE\nDMA 0.1%   100 MTS    $704/mt\n\nBarging: delivery by barge included\n\nValidity: 15/11\n\nPayment: 30 days from date of delivery.\nSubject to availability at time of nomination.\n\nKind regards,\nSofia Borg\nMarine Fuels\nFor and on behalf of Harbourlight Energy\nT +39 23 6376 1779 | sofia.borg@harbourlight.example\n</email_document>"
